{"availability":"available","full":"csharikrishna/panelprobe","name":"panelprobe","description":"Pixel-perfect display test patterns in your browser — OLED true black, dead pixels, motion clarity, gamma, banding & touch. Free, open source, no tracking.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-12T15:22:41Z","updated":"2026-09-13T07:27:50Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://csharikrishna.github.io/panelprobe/","topics":["backlight-bleed","calibration","dead-pixel","display-test","gamma","github-pages","html5-canvas","monitor-test","motion-blur","oled","screen-test","vanilla-javascript"],"demo":"https://csharikrishna.github.io/panelprobe/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:24.482Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:24.482Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:24.482Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T20:10:24.482Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Display test patterns and calibration aids for OLED, IPS, and mobile screens, running entirely in your browser.","Test videos are compressed. Codecs smear near-black detail and add banding and blocking, which are exactly the artifacts you're trying to spot. PanelProbe draws every pattern losslessly to a canvas mapped 1:1 to your device pixels. There's nothing to install and nothing leaves your machine."],"features":["26 test patterns in five categories, each with a one-key shortcut.","Test All steps through the 24 non-strobe tests automatically — 10 seconds each, with pause and skip.","Guided Wizard walks you through nine pass/issue checks. It produces a report you can print or save as PDF, or export as JSON, with advice for each issue.","True 1:1 pixel mapping. The canvas backing store follows the device-pixel content box, so it stays exact even at fractional scaling (125%, 150%).","Refresh-rate detection snaps to common panel rates (60–540 Hz). Motion tests render at the native rate."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/csharikrishna/panelprobe/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"232e1d347dcedca615a59245c9257740ecd913279b84bce8947f109ec1807a98","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:24.559Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:24.559Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Display test patterns and calibration aids for OLED, IPS, and mobile screens, running entirely in your browser.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/csharikrishna/panelprobe/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"232e1d347dcedca615a59245c9257740ecd913279b84bce8947f109ec1807a98","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/csharikrishna/panelprobe/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:24.559Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-09-13T07:27:50Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/csharikrishna/panelprobe/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:24.560Z","hash":"232e1d347dcedca615a59245c9257740ecd913279b84bce8947f109ec1807a98","originalBytes":8051,"storedBytes":8051,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["test","tests","npm","studio","touch","chrome","color","flashing","fonts","gamma","noise","panelprobe","patterns","pixel","run","server","static","stress","after","assets","banding","black","checks","dead","detail","docs","each","every","fullscreen","glow","ips","license","mobile","motion","oled","open","report","scaling","smoke","steps","stuck","through","visible","what","white","above","aids","any","architecture.md","automatically","bar","bash","bleed","box","browser","burn-in","calibration","canvas","card","catalog","clipping","code","contributing","contributing.md","controls","current","dark","design","dev","digitizer","dimming","edge","file","frame","fringing","full-resolution","gradient","gray","halos","hud","images","install","key","keyboard","labels","level","levels","links","lint","move","near-black","notch","nothing","only","page","panel","pattern","pause","pointer","pwm","retained","